    {
      "source": "Returns the bindable value with the given index. Bindable means, that <a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> and <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> values are\nskipped without noticed in the index. For a method signature taking <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>, <a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> ,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>, <code>#getBindableParameter(1)</code> would return the second <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> value.",
      "translation": "返回具有给定索引的可绑定值。可绑定意味着在索引中会跳过 <a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 值而不予注意。对于接受 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>、<a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 的方法签名，<code>#getBindableParameter(1)</code> 将返回第二个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns an iterator over all <em>bindable</em> parameters. This means parameters implementing <a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> or\n<a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> will not be included in this <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回所有<em>可绑定</em>参数的迭代器。这意味着实现<a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>或<a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>的参数将不包含在此<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Iterator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Iterator</code></a>中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
